## Errors
@narrator{when="has(run.missing) && run.missing == 'ok'"}: absent is false
@narrator{when="run.i != 0 && run.i / run.zero > 1"}: divide error is false
@narrator{when="run.i == 3 || has(run.missing)"}: short circuit
